  "created": "2023-08-04T19:17:03.271Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I just thought of something that will benefit a lot of people. a lot of people complain that they are on people's live streams in VR. What would be amazing is if they was an opt out button inside of vr chats settings, Which makes you invisible and inaudible for anybody's stream camera. think of it as like a privacy setting.",
